# Kling 4.0 Official API

使用对应区域的新版 Bearer API Key。中国区地址为 https://api-beijing.klingai.com，国际区为 https://api-singapore.klingai.com。两种型号都可在 Omni 中引用视频。单独提供的北京渠道示例只对无输入视频的组合报价。模型设置从绑定版本读取模式、分辨率和时长范围。

后端从生成的 `kling-v4-official.yingce-plugin` 包加载，不依赖系统内置 `host:` 适配器。

完整接口见 [docs/interface.md](docs/interface.md)。

---

# Kling 4.0 Official API 接口字段

## 协议身份

- 插件 ID：`kling-v4-official`。
- Provider ID：`kling-v4-official`。
- 能力：`video`。
- 默认 Base URL：``。
- 鉴权驱动：`bearer`。
- 创建：`POST /text-to-video/{{model}}`。
- 查询：`GET /tasks`。

## 配置字段

| 字段 | 类型 | 必填 | 含义 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `apiKey` | secret | 是 | API Key |

## 统一字段映射

| 统一字段 | 类型 | 必填 | 上游映射 | 说明 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `model` | string | 是 | `URL path` | kling-4.0 或 kling-4.0-flash。 |
| `operation` | string | 否 | `endpoint` | 文生、图生、全能参考可显式选择。 |
| `prompt` | string | 是 | `prompt / contents[].text` | 英文与非英文按官方混合配额校验。 |
| `images` | media[] | 否 | `contents` | 首帧、中间帧、尾帧、参考图。 |
| `videos` | media[] | 否 | `contents` | 特征参考或待编辑视频。 |
| `duration` | integer | 否 | `settings.duration` | 省略时上游从提示词或待编辑视频推断。 |
| `aspectRatio` | string | 否 | `settings.aspect_ratio` | 图生省略，文生六种固定比例，全能参考另支持 adaptive。 |
| `resolution` | string | 否 | `settings.resolution` | 标准版支持 720p 与 1080p，Flash 仅支持 720p。 |
| `watermark` | boolean | 否 | `options.watermark_info.enabled` | 请求并保存水印版本。 |
| `providerOptions` | object | 否 | `contents / settings.audio` | 仅接受本插件声明的素材角色、ID、主体、音色与音频处理选项。 |

## 上游请求模板逐字段清单

下表由插件请求模板生成，覆盖 body、query、headers 和 multipart 文件声明中的每个字段。

| 上游位置 | 值或转换表达式 |
| --- | --- |
| `create.method` | `"POST"` |
| `create.path` | `"/text-to-video/{{model}}"` |
| `create.originPath` | `true` |
| `create.contentType` | `"application/json"` |
| `create.pathTemplate` | `{"$concat":["/",{"$if":{"condition":{"$eq":[{"$ref":"bindings.operation"},"text_to_video"]},"then":"text-to-video","else":{"$if":{"condition":{"$eq":[{"$ref":"bindings.operation"},"image_to_video"]},"then":"image-to-video","else":"omni-video"}}}},"/",{"$ref":"request.model"}]}` |
| `create.body.prompt` | `{"$if":{"condition":{"$eq":[{"$ref":"bindings.operation"},"text_to_video"]},"then":{"$ref":"request.prompt"},"else":null}}` |
| `create.body.contents` | `{"$if":{"condition":{"$not":{"$eq":[{"$ref":"bindings.operation"},"text_to_video"]}},"then":{"$concatArrays":[[{"type":"prompt","text":{"$ref":"request.prompt"}}],{"$if":{"condition":{"$and":[{"$eq":[{"$ref":"request.model"},"kling-4.0-flash"]},{"$eq":[{"$ref":"bindings.operation"},"image_to_video"]}]},"then":{"$map":{"from":{"$filter":{"from":{"$ref":"bindings.imageParts"},"as":"part","where":{"$eq":[{"$ref":"part.type"},"first_frame"]}}},"as":"frame","in":{"type":"first_frame","url":{"$ref":"frame.url"}}}},"else":{"$ref":"bindings.parts"}}}]},"else":null}}` |
| `create.body.settings` | `{"$omitEmpty":{"duration":{"$ref":"request.output.duration"},"resolution":{"$ref":"request.output.resolution"},"aspect_ratio":{"$if":{"condition":{"$not":{"$eq":[{"$ref":"bindings.operation"},"image_to_video"]}},"then":{"$ref":"request.output.aspectRatio"},"else":null}},"audio":{"$if":{"condition":{"$eq":[{"$ref":"bindings.operation"},"reference_to_video"]},"then":{"$ref":"request.providerOptions.kling-v4-official.audio"},"else":null}}}}` |
| `create.body.options.watermark_info.enabled` | `{"$ref":"request.watermark"}` |
| `poll.method` | `"GET"` |
| `poll.path` | `"/tasks"` |
| `poll.originPath` | `true` |
| `poll.query.task_ids` | `{"$ref":"taskId"}` |

## Provider 扩展键

- `providerOptions.kling-v4-official.audio`

动态模型或工作流允许使用文档声明的完整 `parameters/input/extra_body` 对象；该对象是协议本身的开放 schema，不会被宿主裁剪。

## 响应映射逐字段清单

| 映射位置 | 上游路径或转换表达式 |
| --- | --- |
| `response.taskId` | `{"$first":{"$map":{"from":[{"$coalesce":[{"$if":{"condition":{"$ref":"taskId"},"then":{"$first":{"$filter":{"from":{"$ref":"response.data"},"as":"entry","where":{"$eq":[{"$ref":"entry.id"},{"$ref":"taskId"}]}}}},"else":{"$ref":"response.data"}}},{"missing":true}]}],"as":"task","in":{"$ref":"task.id"}}}}` |
| `response.status` | `{"$first":{"$map":{"from":[{"$coalesce":[{"$if":{"condition":{"$ref":"taskId"},"then":{"$first":{"$filter":{"from":{"$ref":"response.data"},"as":"entry","where":{"$eq":[{"$ref":"entry.id"},{"$ref":"taskId"}]}}}},"else":{"$ref":"response.data"}}},{"missing":true}]}],"as":"task","in":{"$if":{"condition":{"$and":[{"$eq":[{"$ref":"response.code"},0]},{"$and":[{"$eq":[{"$ref":"task.id"},{"$toString":{"$ref":"task.id"}}]},{"$gt":[{"$len":{"$trim":{"$ref":"task.id"}}},0]}]},{"$in":[{"$ref":"task.status"},["submitted","processing","succeeded","failed"]]},{"$or":[{"$ne":[{"$ref":"task.status"},"succeeded"]},{"$gt":[{"$len":{"$filter":{"from":{"$ref":"task.outputs"},"as":"output","where":{"$and":[{"$eq":[{"$ref":"output.type"},"video"]},{"$publicHttpsUrl":{"$if":{"condition":{"$ref":"request.output.watermark"},"then":{"$ref":"output.watermark_url"},"else":{"$ref":"output.url"}}}}]}}}},0]}]}]},"then":{"$if":{"condition":{"$eq":[{"$ref":"task.status"},"submitted"]},"then":"pending","else":{"$ref":"task.status"}}},"else":"failed"}}}}}` |
| `response.message` | `{"$first":{"$map":{"from":[{"$coalesce":[{"$if":{"condition":{"$ref":"taskId"},"then":{"$first":{"$filter":{"from":{"$ref":"response.data"},"as":"entry","where":{"$eq":[{"$ref":"entry.id"},{"$ref":"taskId"}]}}}},"else":{"$ref":"response.data"}}},{"missing":true}]}],"as":"task","in":{"$concat":[{"$coalesce":[{"$ref":"task.message"},{"$ref":"response.message"},"可灵任务回执"]}," [code=",{"$ref":"response.code"},", request_id=",{"$ref":"response.request_id"},"]",{"$if":{"condition":{"$not":{"$and":[{"$eq":[{"$ref":"response.code"},0]},{"$and":[{"$eq":[{"$ref":"task.id"},{"$toString":{"$ref":"task.id"}}]},{"$gt":[{"$len":{"$trim":{"$ref":"task.id"}}},0]}]},{"$in":[{"$ref":"task.status"},["submitted","processing","succeeded","failed"]]},{"$or":[{"$ne":[{"$ref":"task.status"},"succeeded"]},{"$gt":[{"$len":{"$filter":{"from":{"$ref":"task.outputs"},"as":"output","where":{"$and":[{"$eq":[{"$ref":"output.type"},"video"]},{"$publicHttpsUrl":{"$if":{"condition":{"$ref":"request.output.watermark"},"then":{"$ref":"output.watermark_url"},"else":{"$ref":"output.url"}}}}]}}}},0]}]}]}},"then":" 任务 ID、状态或视频结果无效。","else":""}}]}}}}` |
| `response.videos` | `{"$first":{"$map":{"from":[{"$coalesce":[{"$if":{"condition":{"$ref":"taskId"},"then":{"$first":{"$filter":{"from":{"$ref":"response.data"},"as":"entry","where":{"$eq":[{"$ref":"entry.id"},{"$ref":"taskId"}]}}}},"else":{"$ref":"response.data"}}},{"missing":true}]}],"as":"task","in":{"$if":{"condition":{"$and":[{"$and":[{"$eq":[{"$ref":"response.code"},0]},{"$and":[{"$eq":[{"$ref":"task.id"},{"$toString":{"$ref":"task.id"}}]},{"$gt":[{"$len":{"$trim":{"$ref":"task.id"}}},0]}]},{"$in":[{"$ref":"task.status"},["submitted","processing","succeeded","failed"]]},{"$or":[{"$ne":[{"$ref":"task.status"},"succeeded"]},{"$gt":[{"$len":{"$filter":{"from":{"$ref":"task.outputs"},"as":"output","where":{"$and":[{"$eq":[{"$ref":"output.type"},"video"]},{"$publicHttpsUrl":{"$if":{"condition":{"$ref":"request.output.watermark"},"then":{"$ref":"output.watermark_url"},"else":{"$ref":"output.url"}}}}]}}}},0]}]}]},{"$eq":[{"$ref":"task.status"},"succeeded"]}]},"then":{"$map":{"from":{"$filter":{"from":{"$ref":"task.outputs"},"as":"output","where":{"$and":[{"$eq":[{"$ref":"output.type"},"video"]},{"$publicHttpsUrl":{"$if":{"condition":{"$ref":"request.output.watermark"},"then":{"$ref":"output.watermark_url"},"else":{"$ref":"output.url"}}}}]}}},"as":"output","in":{"url":{"$if":{"condition":{"$ref":"request.output.watermark"},"then":{"$ref":"output.watermark_url"},"else":{"$ref":"output.url"}}},"id":{"$ref":"output.id"}}}},"else":null}}}}}` |
| `response.usage` | `{"$first":{"$map":{"from":[{"$coalesce":[{"$if":{"condition":{"$ref":"taskId"},"then":{"$first":{"$filter":{"from":{"$ref":"response.data"},"as":"entry","where":{"$eq":[{"$ref":"entry.id"},{"$ref":"taskId"}]}}}},"else":{"$ref":"response.data"}}},{"missing":true}]}],"as":"task","in":{"$ref":"task.usage"}}}}` |
| `response.errorPaths[0]` | `"code"` |
| `response.resultEphemeral` | `true` |

## 响应与错误

插件把上游 task/status/text/media/usage 映射为统一结果。临时媒体 URL 标记为 ephemeral，由宿主立即下载持久化。HTTP 错误、业务 code 和 error object 保持失败语义，不包装成成功。

## 兼容边界

按上游模型与生成方式解析端点。单次创建后按 data.id 在原渠道回查 /tasks。标准版和 Flash 的关键帧、音色、清晰度与总时长限制不同。具体 API 与渠道定价见影策的《官方视频模型与插件版本》。

